  {
    "episode_id": 83286,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83286.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Now, you wrote this book while serving as a US Senator, which I imagine had its demands, but at the same time, you were able to do some really great research that went into telling the story. What was it like to go back, not only that you had personal experience, but there were some things you said that you didn't have the opportunity to experience. So what was it like to go back to recreate some of those moments and tell them those stories in the book?",
