    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83286.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "Senator, I want to ask you finally, you're somebody who recounts in the book how you came to serve in the Army. 9-11 played a transformational role in your life. You finished law school later and listed. You've gone on now to write this incredible book called Sacred Duty to help us all understand some of the sacrifices that go into it. What would you like listeners to take away most if they were to get a copy of your book?",
